#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Minn Admin"
msgstr "Minn Admin"

#: minn-admin.php
#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://minnadmin.com"
msgstr "https://minnadmin.com"

#: minn-admin.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"A reimagined WordPress admin experience. Fast, focused and beautiful. "
"Served at /minn-admin/."
msgstr ""
"تجربه‌ای نو از مدیریت وردپرس؛ سریع، متمرکز و زیبا. در مسیر /minn-admin/ "
"ارائه می‌شود."

